     "text": "03"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Be the First Choice for All Groundbreakers"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Doosan Bobcat is dedicated to strengthening its leadership position across its entire product portfolio. To achieve sustainable growth, the company prioritizes diversifying its product offerings and globalizing its footprint, all while delivering innovative products and services."
    }
   ],
